      "topic": "基础设置",
      "nearby_snippets": [
        {
          "text": "First\nthings first, let's look at your settings,",
          "start": 34.116,
          "duration": 1.834
        },
        {
          "text": "because there's a lot of important stuff\nhere.",
          "start": 35.95,
          "duration": 1.866
        },
        {
          "text": "First,\nyou're going to want to go to combat",
          "start": 37.816,
          "duration": 1.8
        },
        {
          "text": "target scanning\nand then change your preferred",
          "start": 39.616,
          "duration": 1.934
        },
        {
          "text": "search direction to front of camera.",
          "start": 41.55,
          "duration": 1.833
        },
        {
          "text": "This stops you",
          "start": 43.383,
          "duration": 0.633
        },
        {
          "text": "from jumping to random enemies behind you\ninstead of your preferred target.",
          "start": 44.016,
          "duration": 3.167
        },
        {
          "text": "Now this one's for melee classes.",
          "start": 47.216,
          "duration": 1.534
        },
        {
          "text": "You want to go to combat and controls,",
          "start": 48.75,
          "duration": 1.716
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "seconds": 134,
      "topic": "技能点与特化",
      "nearby_snippets": [
        {
          "text": "All these drops that you get\nare going to be important in the future.",
          "start": 131.35,
          "duration": 3.0
        },
        {
          "text": "If you don't know where to allocate\nyour skill points",
          "start": 134.383,
          "duration": 1.883
        },
        {
          "text": "when you first get into the game,",
          "start": 136.266,
          "duration": 1.317
        },
        {
          "text": "putting skill points into your basic\nattacks are never a wrong move.",
          "start": 137.583,
          "duration": 3.0
        },
        {
          "text": "This is your left click\nand your right click.",
          "start": 140.583,
          "duration": 1.683
        },
        {
          "text": "You use them every single fight,\nso every point pays off.",
          "start": 142.266,
          "duration": 2.95
        },
        {
          "text": "It's also worth mentioning",
          "start": 145.216,
          "duration": 1.0
        },
        {
          "text": "that you can reset your skill tree\nwhenever you want, and it's free.",
          "start": 146.216,
          "duration": 3.434
        },
        {
          "text": "When a skill gets to level eight,\nyou unlock a specialty slot",
          "start": 149.666,
          "duration": 2.634
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "seconds": 158,
      "topic": "Daevanion",
      "nearby_snippets": [
        {
          "text": "You got to make sure\nyou actually put the skill into the slot.",
          "start": 155.3,
          "duration": 2.516
        },
        {
          "text": "Then there's a Daevanion board,\none of your biggest sources of power.",
          "start": 157.816,
          "duration": 3.0
        },
        {
          "text": "This might look scary, but it's not.",
          "start": 160.866,
          "duration": 1.317
        },
        {
          "text": "Your main focus should be the blue\nand green tiles.",
          "start": 162.183,
          "duration": 2.283
        },
        {
          "text": "Blue levels up your active skills.\nGreen levels up your passives.",
          "start": 164.466,
          "duration": 2.917
        },
        {
          "text": "In the skills tab,\nyou can only level a skill up to ten,",
          "start": 167.383,
          "duration": 2.4
        },
        {
          "text": "and these tiles\nare how you push past that.",
          "start": 169.783,
          "duration": 2.083
        },
        {
          "text": "There are four of these boards\nfor PVE, the last one that has purple text",
          "start": 171.866,
          "duration": 3.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "seconds": 233,
      "topic": "探索成长",
      "nearby_snippets": [
        {
          "text": "Which brings me to my next section.",
          "start": 230.866,
          "duration": 1.8
        },
        {
          "text": "Exploring isn't just sightseeing in Aion",
          "start": 232.666,
          "duration": 2.2
        },
        {
          "text": "two, it's\none of the best ways to get stronger.",
          "start": 234.866,
          "duration": 2.484
        },
        {
          "text": "When you open your map for the first time,",
          "start": 237.35,
          "duration": 1.516
        },
        {
          "text": "you're going to see\na bunch of question marks.",
          "start": 238.866,
          "duration": 1.434
        },
        {
          "text": "And these question marks could either be\nan enemy camp or a sealed dungeon.",
          "start": 240.3,
          "duration": 3.516
        },
        {
          "text": "I'll get to the camps, but let's talk\nabout the sealed dungeons first.",
          "start": 243.866,
          "duration": 2.8
        },
        {
          "text": "So these dungeons are short\nsolo instances scattered around the map.",
          "start": 246.666,
          "duration": 3.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "seconds": 493,
      "topic": "满级之后",
      "nearby_snippets": [
        {
          "text": "you're not going to be spending\nany Odyle. Energy.",
          "start": 490.583,
          "duration": 1.95
        },
        {
          "text": "The max level in this game is level 45.",
          "start": 492.533,
          "duration": 2.167
        },
        {
          "text": "Once you hit 45,\nkeep doing your main quest.",
          "start": 494.7,
          "duration": 2.233
        },
        {
          "text": "The story doesn't end that max level,",
          "start": 496.933,
          "duration": 1.767
        },
        {
          "text": "so keep doing it because you're going\nto get some great rewards.",
          "start": 498.7,
          "duration": 2.716
        },
        {
          "text": "Outside of that, it's\nall about gear score.",
          "start": 501.416,
          "duration": 2.2
        },
        {
          "text": "At 700 Gear Score,",
          "start": 503.616,
          "duration": 1.15
        },
        {
          "text": "you unlock your first real endgame\ndungeon, one star cave, and drop near.",
